{"unit_id":"serra006__dsh-connect-opencode#feature-1","repo":"serra006/dsh-connect-opencode","commit":"14533bdb09542fb1fa3095a872823ea570e11172","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Connect OpenCode 的功能「发现免费模型」：从 OpenCode 的 provider 目录筛出已连接、费用各项为零且支持文本输出的模型，并注册到 DSH 模型选择器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/catalog.js:11-39","lib/index.js:225-249"]}
